Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 18:27:14 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] OpenSpool: parse additional_color_hexes for multicolor spools

OpenSpool tags may carry extra colors in `additional_color_hexes`
(used by the Snapmaker U1 extended firmware for dual/rainbow spools).
The processor previously kept only `color_hex`, dropping the rest.

Append up to 4 additional colors (5 total, matching the U1's
FILAMENT_PROTO_COLOR_NUMS_MAX) to `colors`, using the tag's alpha.
Single-color tags produce the same output and unique_id as before.

Adds a dual-color (red/blue) OpenSpool fixture.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011NVRoJLjL7JBmLBtmjrTrv
---
 src/tag/openspool/processor.py                |  10 ++++++++--
 .../eSUN PLA Silk Red Blue OpenSpool.bin      | Bin 0 -> 540 bytes
 .../eSUN PLA Silk Red Blue OpenSpool.yml      |  18 ++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 26 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 test/tags/OpenSpool/eSUN PLA Silk Red Blue OpenSpool.bin
 create mode 100644 test/tags/OpenSpool/eSUN PLA Silk Red Blue OpenSpool.yml

diff --git a/src/tag/openspool/processor.py b/src/tag/openspool/processor.py
index f8eb523..ec6f7ad 100644
--- a/src/tag/openspool/processor.py
+++ b/src/tag/openspool/processor.py
@@ -47,6 +47,12 @@ class OpenspoolTagProcessor(NdefTagProcessor):
             alpha = max(0x00, min(0xFF, int(data.get('alpha', 'FF'), 16)))
             color_argb = (alpha << 24) | color_hex
 
+            colors = [color_argb]
+            additional = data.get('additional_color_hexes') or []
+            if isinstance(additional, list):
+                for extra_hex in additional[:4]:
+                    colors.append((alpha << 24) | self.__parse_color_hex(extra_hex))
+
             try:
                 diameter_mm = float(data.get('diameter', 1.75))
             except (ValueError, TypeError):
@@ -76,11 +82,11 @@ class OpenspoolTagProcessor(NdefTagProcessor):
 
             return GenericFilament(
                 source_processor=self.name,
-                unique_id=GenericFilament.generate_unique_id("OpenSpool", brand, main_type, subtype, color_argb),
+                unique_id=GenericFilament.generate_unique_id("OpenSpool", brand, main_type, subtype, *colors),
                 manufacturer=brand,
                 type=main_type,
                 modifiers=[subtype] if subtype else [],
-                colors=[color_argb],
+                colors=colors,
                 diameter_mm=diameter_mm,
                 weight_grams=weight_grams,
                 hotend_min_temp_c=min_temp,
